 ## Consequences
 
-TBC
+The `operatorSpec.namingConvention` property is available on `RoleAssignment` in API versions `2020-08-01-preview`
+and `2022-04-01`, and on `RoleDefinition` in `2022-04-01`. It accepts `stable` (the default, producing the existing
+deterministic UUID-based name) or `random` (producing a new random UUID), and only applies when no AzureName is
+explicitly provided. The setting is operator-only and is not sent to Azure.
+
+Users choosing `random` must manage the AzureName themselves when exporting/importing or migrating resources, since
+a new UUID is generated on each creation.
 
